{"id":"vod_bf_7301","vodId":"7301","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"调教咖啡厅","name_cn":"调教咖啡厅","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-8/ba8bea48607c01b62ddbb22ddfe489eb.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一间看似普通的咖啡厅里，在这里工作的服务生们，每个人都有属于他们独特的属性，而他们在工作期间所要完成的任务，就是尽力的去扮演符合自己属性的角色，做出相对应的言行，令特殊的顾客群体感到满意。　　樱之宫莓香（和气杏未 配音）是一个个性安静而又礼貌的女孩，可是，让她没有想到的是，她被分配到的属性竟然是“抖S”。在扮演抖S的过程中，莓香的某些隐藏特质似乎被激发了。除了莓香外，在咖啡店工作的还有傲娇娘日向夏帆（鬼头明里 配音）、扮演妹妹角色的星川麻冬（春野杏 配音）、看似人气偶像实为伪娘的神崎日照（徳井青空 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:05:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/diaojiaokafeiting/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:13.568Z"}